Subject: [PATCH] hash-sign landing edit LE-doc: formula docstrings and proof
 sketches

Docstrings only (policy.md: each public declaration's docstring states its formula; every
nontrivial proof has a proof sketch). A backticked formula matching the statement is added
to the first sentence of every NO-FORMULA row of the r1 docaudit among the new public
declarations (109 rows); existing reference tags and proof sketches are kept. A Proof
sketch is added to HashSignFill.polyTimeComputable_collisionRun, the only proof of 15 or
more lines without one. Module docstrings already carry Main definitions and Main results.
No statement, proof, name, attribute or import changes. The target
hashAndSign_oneTimeSecure is unchanged; Authentication.lean is not touched.

